    "Id": "mechdef_trebaruna_TR-XB",
    "Name": "Trebaruna TR-XB",
    "Details": "The TR-XB is protected by 16 tons of Durallex Heavy Armor, with CASE embedded into its right torso. The 'Mech uses a XL 285-rated Fusion Engine as its source of power, to aid the 'Mech's ability to cope with a lack of rear-facing weapons and a modest top speed, the design was also given five Improved Jump Jets. The Trebaruna was designed to fight its opponents at long ranges, with its main weapon being its right torso-mounted Gauss Rifle, with 2 tons of ammunition, and supported by three Light PPC found in the opposite torso. These weapons are guided by a Targeting Computer located in the 'Mech's left torso. The Trebaruna is fitted with ten double heat sinks to help cope with its weapon and engine heat.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Command Mech</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.17</color></b>",
    "Icon": "Barghest"
  },
